request.description:
Lists all active orders for the authenticated serviceman. Returns assignments with status `accepted`, `on_way`, or `in_progress` (excludes `assigned` pending requests and terminal states). Cancelled bookings are also filtered out.

**Auth:** Bearer token (Serviceman)

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "orders": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "status": "accepted",
      "booking": {
        "id": 10,
        "booking_number": "BK-2026031001",
        "service_date": "2026-03-15",
        "service": {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "AC Repair & Service"
        },
        "slot": {
          "start": "09:00 AM",
          "end": "11:00 AM"
        },
        "customer": {
          "name": "Rahul Sharma"
        },
        "address": {
          "formatted_address": "123, MG Road, Koramangala, Bangalore 560034"
        },
        "total_amount": 1299.00
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

**Field Notes:**
- `id` — Booking assignment ID (integer)
- `status` — String value: `accepted`, `on_way`, or `in_progress`
- `booking.service_date` — Format: `Y-m-d`
- `booking.service` — Primary service from main booking detail; `null` if not found
- `booking.slot` — Time slot with `start`/`end` in `h:i A` format (e.g., `09:00 AM`); `null` if not available
- `booking.total_amount` — From invoice; `null` if no invoice exists

